{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "xwypdtvn2g6rkgts", "title": "非常牛逼，200毫秒干到10毫秒，利用MySQL JSON特性优化千万级订单表", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"ILDUw\" id=\"ILDUw\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4efbba8\" id=\"ue4efbba8\">场景描述</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u07b23276\" id=\"u07b23276\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07bea153\" id=\"u07bea153\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在一个电商平台中，为了生成一份详细的销售报告，需要从多个表中获取数据。这些表包括订单、客户、产品、库存、支付、物流、地区、分类、促销、和评价等信息。假设需要从以下10个表中获取数据：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub62719fd\" id=\"ub62719fd\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1715477077880-cc8ba393-81e8-430e-9556-7c3b8b156068.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u800bbf74-d011-4669-8493-4c38f0380f8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u99876991-bad7-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A654%2C%22height%22%3A529%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A33439%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A654%2C%22originHeight%22%3A529%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROMOTIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A461%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATEGORIES%22%2C%22x%22%3A264%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REGIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHIPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A471%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E8%AF%84%E4%BB%B7)%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A461%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E7%89%A9%E6%B5%81)%22%2C%22x%22%3A476%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E4%BF%83%E9%94%80)%22%2C%22x%22%3A471%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98)%22%2C%22x%22%3A478%2C%22y%22%3A64%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CUSTOMERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A272%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7)%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INVENTORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A474%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RODUICTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A270%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E5%9C%B0%E5%8C%BA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95)%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81)%22%2C%22x%22%3A274%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PAYMENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVIEWS%22%2C%22x%22%3A273%2C%22y%22%3A447%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORDERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A274%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98)%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue92b6e3d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8e96892e\" id=\"u8e96892e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u917e6b06\" id=\"u917e6b06\">orders（订单）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3e3d4c86\" id=\"u3e3d4c86\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c013f5b\" id=\"u8c013f5b\">customers（客户）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37490568\" id=\"u37490568\"><span data-lake-id=\"u424546f5\" id=\"u424546f5\">products（产品）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7a2247ef\" id=\"u7a2247ef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2eb0dc42\" id=\"u2eb0dc42\">inventory（库存）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u475782c1\" id=\"u475782c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f851354\" id=\"u7f851354\">payments（支付）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u082992af\" id=\"u082992af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f84562a\" id=\"u6f84562a\">shipping（物流）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf7cc2b2d\" id=\"uf7cc2b2d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c62cc9a\" id=\"u6c62cc9a\">regions（地区）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u68ba1b85\" id=\"u68ba1b85\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc7ef4bd\" id=\"ucc7ef4bd\">categories（分类）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5cdf81d8\" id=\"u5cdf81d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4abe7f0\" id=\"ue4abe7f0\">promotions（促销）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1e588067\" id=\"u1e588067\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7d36b9a\" id=\"ud7d36b9a\">reviews（评价）</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"RKukV\" id=\"RKukV\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f632b2b\" id=\"u5f632b2b\">业务需求</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u0851f8c6\" id=\"u0851f8c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u390bac5c\" id=\"u390bac5c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">生成一份报告，包含每个订单的详细信息，包括订单ID、客户姓名、产品名称、库存状态、支付方式、物流信息、客户地区、产品分类、促销活动、以及客户评价等。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"qOOVW\" id=\"qOOVW\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ae976c5\" id=\"u9ae976c5\">查询示例</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u8ee9ad34\" id=\"u8ee9ad34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u173bb91a\" id=\"u173bb91a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">为了获取这些信息，我们需要进行多表关联查询。查询语句可能如下所示</span><span data-lake-id=\"u44651044\" id=\"u44651044\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SELECT%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20o.order_id%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20c.name%20AS%20customer_name%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20p.name%20AS%20product_name%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20i.stock_status%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20pay.payment_method%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20s.shipping_status%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20r.region_name%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20cat.category_name%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20promo.promotion_name%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20rev.review_content%5CnFROM%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20orders%20o%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20customers%20c%20ON%20o.customer_id%20%3D%20c.customer_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20products%20p%20ON%20o.product_id%20%3D%20p.product_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20inventory%20i%20ON%20p.product_id%20%3D%20i.product_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20payments%20pay%20ON%20o.payment_id%20%3D%20pay.payment_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20shipping%20s%20ON%20o.shipping_id%20%3D%20s.shipping_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20regions%20r%20ON%20c.region_id%20%3D%20r.region_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20categories%20cat%20ON%20p.category_id%20%3D%20cat.category_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20promotions%20promo%20ON%20o.promotion_id%20%3D%20promo.promotion_id%5CnJOIN%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20reviews%20rev%20ON%20o.review_id%20%3D%20rev.review_id%3B%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Darcula%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kqHRI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"XVWz6\" id=\"XVWz6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4c441de\" id=\"uf4c441de\">效率问题</span></h1><ol list=\"u293c5cfa\"><li fid=\"u2749bdc1\" data-lake-id=\"u96e58f7b\" id=\"u96e58f7b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab6e7d36\" id=\"uab6e7d36\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">表的数量多</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05c287d3\" id=\"u05c287d3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：以上查询涉及10个表的关联，每个表都有自己的数据量，如果每个表的数据量较大，关联操作会非常耗时。</span></li><li fid=\"u2749bdc1\" data-lake-id=\"u7d7765cb\" id=\"u7d7765cb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6edbc901\" id=\"u6edbc901\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">全表扫描</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6fb89773\" id=\"u6fb89773\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：在没有索引的情况下，查询需要对每个表进行全表扫描，导致查询时间显著增加。</span></li><li fid=\"u2749bdc1\" data-lake-id=\"u6b707603\" id=\"u6b707603\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u99a096b4\" id=\"u99a096b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">数据处理复杂</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3b61db35\" id=\"u3b61db35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：每个订单需要从多个表中获取关联信息，导致查询需要处理大量的数据和复杂的连接操作。</span></li><li fid=\"u2749bdc1\" data-lake-id=\"uea037030\" id=\"uea037030\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc3568860\" id=\"uc3568860\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">性能瓶颈</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30f96938\" id=\"u30f96938\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：由于查询需要大量的计算资源和内存，当数据量非常大时，数据库服务器可能出现性能瓶颈，影响系统的整体性能。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ude54329f\" id=\"ude54329f\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"fgdM0\" id=\"fgdM0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u662ea01d\" id=\"u662ea01d\">解决方案一 : 反范式设计</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1e549d45\" id=\"u1e549d45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5332e449\" id=\"u5332e449\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 77, 77)\">一个版本，这个1.0呢，就是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u17ccd0da\" id=\"u17ccd0da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 77, 77)\">采用反范式设计，基于宽表，也就是我们典型的空间换时间</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ddbc7f3\" id=\"u1ddbc7f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 77, 77)\">，可以看到刚才我们处理慢的一个主要思路呢，就是一个数据表要查询多次才能获得完整的信息。那如果我们把这些数据都。综合到一个宽表里边儿，也就是我们反范式表是不是就可以了呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u89592577\" id=\"u89592577\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1715478313003-c769a5db-e257-4457-ab30-b4f2220000a0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6afaa5f9-7ee4-4ab3-9186-eb2cf6d7613%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u20d80b9e-7c1c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A720%2C%22height%22%3A211%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A15297%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A720%2C%22originHeight%22%3A211%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22123MAPLEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A489%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CUSTOMERADDRESS%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22123MAPLEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A490%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CUSTOMERNAME%22%2C%22x%22%3A364%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222023-05%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222023-05%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORDERDATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CUSTOMERIA%22%2C%22x%22%3A258%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22150.00%22%2C%22x%22%3A186%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22250.00%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRODUCTID%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224560AKST.%22%2C%22x%22%3A489%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AMOUNT%22%2C%22x%22%3A182%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222023-05-%22%2C%22x%22%3A90%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORDERID%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221001%22%2C%22x%22%3A632%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALICE%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22200.00%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22101%22%2C%22x%22%3A257%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221003%22%2C%22x%22%3A634%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221002%22%2C%22x%22%3A633%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22101%22%2C%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2202%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22102%22%2C%22x%22%3A258%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2201%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BOB%22%2C%22x%22%3A361%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2203%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%232a2928%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf8f1d8de%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4dffd92b\" id=\"u4dffd92b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7073055b\" id=\"u7073055b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">其实这个思路非常的好，我们可以比如说把所有的属性呢，以列的形式在这儿呢，都进行体现出来</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"BTrKK\" id=\"BTrKK\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad931587\" id=\"uad931587\">弊端</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uaf89978a\" id=\"uaf89978a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33efeeba\" id=\"u33efeeba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在当前的这个宽表中呢，包含了所有可能会出现的属性，哪一个属性有数据，我们就提取哪一个，但是针对宽表呢，在我们日常工作中啊，并不太推荐使用，有两个原因 :</span></p><ul list=\"ue744f120\"><li fid=\"u17caf168\" data-lake-id=\"u87e5bc1d\" id=\"u87e5bc1d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7b16ccd\" id=\"uf7b16ccd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">它的字段一多以后，字段的动态填充和减少是要锁表的，尤其在数据量一大的时候，比如现在我们针对某一个类型又有一个新的属性，你一旦添加列的时候，整个这个表就锁了。 对于我们的维护非常的不方便.</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u17caf168\" data-lake-id=\"u2ad8bd91\" id=\"u2ad8bd91\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6b820f17\" id=\"u6b820f17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">数据查询的时候非常麻烦,难以基于动态列的方式来进行了提取数据</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u17caf168\" data-lake-id=\"u86f1ff51\" id=\"u86f1ff51\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u230ed28d\" id=\"u230ed28d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">作为宽表还有一些不能解决的问题，难以体现出一对多的关系</span></strong></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"wNHPB\" id=\"wNHPB\"><span data-lake-id=\"u098f37cb\" id=\"u098f37cb\">解决方案二 : mysql5.7后Json特性</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"MCplz\" id=\"MCplz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2aaf0fd3\" id=\"u2aaf0fd3\">一、创建表</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CREATE%20TABLE%20wide_table%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20id%20INT%20AUTO_INCREMENT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20data%20JSON%5Cn)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Darcula%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WsiU0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"faa1p\" id=\"faa1p\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue531eca8\" id=\"ue531eca8\">二、插入数据</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22INSERT%20INTO%20wide_table%20(data)%20VALUES%20%5Cn(JSON_OBJECT('order_id'%2C%201%2C%20'order_date'%2C%20'2023-05-01'%2C%20'amount'%2C%20150.00%2C%20'customer'%2C%20JSON_OBJECT('customer_id'%2C%20101%2C%20'customer_name'%2