"u3abec913\" data-lake-id=\"u2861cbe3\" id=\"u2861cbe3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0529e459\" id=\"u0529e459\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">减少 JOIN 操作</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u065b83bd\" id=\"u065b83bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：将多表数据存储在一个 JSON 列中，可以避免复杂的多表 JOIN 操作，从而提高查询性能。</span></li><li fid=\"u3abec913\" data-lake-id=\"u8e3d3710\" id=\"u8e3d3710\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub7d660ab\" id=\"ub7d660ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">降低查询复杂度</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e57621f\" id=\"u0e57621f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：在查询数据时，只需要读取一个表的一个列即可获取所有相关信息，大大简化了查询逻辑</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"OsgA1\" id=\"OsgA1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub83e0229\" id=\"ub83e0229\">2. 灵活的数据结构</span></h3><ul list=\"ub3a4b88f\"><li fid=\"ued32af62\" data-lake-id=\"ub9b89d99\" id=\"ub9b89d99\"><span data-lake-id=\"u684c467a\" id=\"u684c467a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">动态模式：JSON 列可以存储任意结构化数据，使得表结构更具灵活性，可以方便地应对字段的增加或修改，而无需修改数据库表结构。</span></li><li fid=\"ued32af62\" data-lake-id=\"u9d8b5bb8\" id=\"u9d8b5bb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87f12963\" id=\"u87f12963\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">易于扩展：新增字段时，只需在插入或更新数据时添加对应的 JSON 键值对，而无需修改表的定义</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"IsQxj\" id=\"IsQxj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80272520\" id=\"u80272520\">示例：</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u0f48a613\" id=\"u0f48a613\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5fddfca2\" id=\"u5fddfca2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">插入包含新字段的数据：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22INSERT%20INTO%20wide_table%20(data)%5CnVALUES%20%5Cn(JSON_OBJECT(%5Cn%20%20%20%20'order_id'%2C%202%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20'order_date'%2C%20'2023-05-02'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20'amount'%2C%20200.00%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20'customer'%2C%20JSON_OBJECT(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'customer_id'%2C%20102%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'customer_name'%2C%20'Bob'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'customer_address'%2C%20'456%20Oak%20St.'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'customer_phone'%2C%20'123-456-7890'%20%20--%20%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20'product'%2C%20JSON_OBJECT(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'product_id'%2C%201002%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'product_name'%2C%20'Gizmo'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'product_price'%2C%2075.00%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn))%3B%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Darcula%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P3DOs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"RN5mk\" id=\"RN5mk\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b18142a\" id=\"u1b18142a\">3. 简化数据存储</span></h3><ul list=\"u263abeab\"><li fid=\"ucc5202fd\" data-lake-id=\"ub89d3830\" id=\"ub89d3830\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7079fd4a\" id=\"u7079fd4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">统一的数据存储</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u21a8cef3\" id=\"u21a8cef3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：将相关数据集中存储在一个 JSON 列中，使得数据的存储和管理更加简单。</span></li><li fid=\"ucc5202fd\" data-lake-id=\"u983a0061\" id=\"u983a0061\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua6e7ff3b\" id=\"ua6e7ff3b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">减少表之间的依赖</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9f52140f\" id=\"u9f52140f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：在一个表中存储所有相关信息，减少了表之间的依赖性，降低了数据管理的复杂</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7ed1deae\" id=\"u7ed1deae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">性。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"vKmdk\" id=\"vKmdk\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7aeb9045\" id=\"u7aeb9045\">示例：</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uead7c333\" id=\"uead7c333\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d209c9b\" id=\"u4d209c9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">传统多表结构：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22--%20%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%92%8C%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20orders%20(...)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20customers%20(...)%3B%5CnCREATE%20TABLE%20products%20(...)%3B%5Cn...%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Darcula%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RzFp9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufdc1501f\" id=\"ufdc1501f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40106334\" id=\"u40106334\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">使用 JSON 特性后的结构：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CREATE%20TABLE%20wide_table%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20id%20INT%20AUTO_INCREMENT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20data%20JSON%5Cn)%3B%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Darcula%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22obx8T%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"OUx8z\" id=\"OUx8z\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubeb2b0a2\" id=\"ubeb2b0a2\">4. 数据传输和序列化</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"obFEJ\" id=\"obFEJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f8b110e\" id=\"u9f8b110e\">好处：</span></h4><ul list=\"uf19fc075\"><li fid=\"ud3a25d58\" data-lake-id=\"u4392929c\" id=\"u4392929c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u293c8463\" id=\"u293c8463\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">便于数据传输</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8949f8de\" id=\"u8949f8de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：JSON 格式的数据便于在前后端之间进行传输，尤其适用于 Web 应用。</span></li><li fid=\"ud3a25d58\" data-lake-id=\"u08b67683\" id=\"u08b67683\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u754f79d1\" id=\"u754f79d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">便于序列化和反序列化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u513f8040\" id=\"u513f8040\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：JSON 数据可以方便地进行序列化和反序列化，适用于与其他系统或服务进行数据交换。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"UdUIO\" id=\"UdUIO\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9292aab5\" id=\"u9292aab5\">示例：</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u489da9a2\" id=\"u489da9a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03e3fa75\" id=\"u03e3fa75\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在 Web 应用中传输数据：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22order_id%5C%22%3A%201%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22order_date%5C%22%3A%20%5C%222023-05-01%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22amount%5C%22%3A%20150.00%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22customer%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22customer_id%5C%22%3A%20101%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22customer_name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22Alice%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22customer_address%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22123%20Maple%20St.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Darcula%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y7Bji%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"u5tIx\" id=\"u5tIx\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79a19b00\" id=\"u79a19b00\">总结</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uf8e578a1\" id=\"uf8e578a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u201c1a71\" id=\"u201c1a71\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">使用 MySQL 5.7 的 JSON 特性，可以有效地解决多表多列场景下的数据查询性能问题，同时简化数据结构，增加灵活性，便于数据的传输和管理。这种方法特别适用于需要处理复杂数据结构的应用场景。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 2135, "description": "场景描述在一个电商平台中，为了生成一份详细的销售报告，需要从多个表中获取数据。这些表包括订单、客户、产品、库存、支付、物流、地区、分类、促销、和评价等信息。假设需要从以下10个表中获取数据：orders（订单）customers（客户）products（产品）inventory（库存）paym...", "updated_at": "2025-12-03T05:31:19.000Z", "created_at": "2024-05-12T00:34:40.000Z", "id": 169297251, "status": 1}